    fine: `If you answered WordPress to three of the four, hire a WordPress developer, ideally one who can sit in your office. We are the wrong choice for that: three people in India cannot be your on-call retainer in Deira on a Tuesday afternoon, and we will say so on the first call rather than the fourth.`,
